  "description": "One day, Taejun finds his cat, Tango, eating a mountain of meat-based dishes in front of Hyomin's eatery.\n\n\"My cat is a vegetarian!\"  \n\"Since when did cats become herbivores?! They are carnivores!\"\n\nTaejun, a stern, stubborn vet who puts cats above people, meets Hyomin, a wholehearted chef who makes scrumptious meat-based dishes.\n\nCan these two very different people find love?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/58076879)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/mon-chat-est-vegetarien)",
